    "title": "Four in a Row - 2 Player",
    "description": "2 Player Games are your best choice for games that you can play with your friends.\r\nHave fun with your family and friends while playing this classic board game!\r\nEnjoy Four in a Row, a casual and fun game from our childhood where you have to connect 4 tokens before your opponent does. Play now the best board game! Play Four in a Row!\r\n4 in a Row is easy to learn, but hard to master! Challenge your friends to see who is the best.\r\nOver a thousand levels await you! Download it and join millions of people around the world!\r\nFEATURES\r\n- The difficulty of the game will increase over time.\r\n- No need to register in the game.\r\n- Never lose your progress with our automatic saving system.\r\n- Available for your cell phone, 7 inch tablet or 10 inch HD devices.\r\n- Off course is a 2 Player Games!\r\nFour in a Row, Game created by The Angry Kraken.",
